{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"d26bc86ae855f1360631c115056cb32364d3b7a8ae31a92bb7d290b3e56ee459","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"06746a50f60b389b9b0a6dd278dc02b4dedfe5341431971ca9eb65f07a0d0b24","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"074da41895f64ba37e0f5cc7dfd74e45c0e58d3cca4db6562d0e2d1f2610f847","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"07679a7e7429815b10a8867969d65ba9761d58568ddb7d4df1b7743e5d0bf806","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/tinkers/explosive.lua:223 (source unpinned): 'packs a punch' means the shot hits hard. It says nothing about the shell being heavy. The target '很重的特殊弹头' turns this into a weight description and loses the meaning. It should say the shot is powerful or hits hard, e.g. '威力十足的特殊弹药'."},{"revision_key":"077d4a024ae4f1b6cb378f98cca954b0ca32776529ead34f486b25fcee7228ed","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"07910af31c29444dddd1cc563e309a515b63e56f47e0d37d35cbb18ddd27302d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"08a02984f854011f0143745ce0ed2edf004c78930e0181ef64fb7b09e0d57f40","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"090b9785f173eaa7318d665e582a0ddde91dfd2dc1b79b192df71e7b546593e8","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"0a43ee37f51040f16fdedfd67fe5e8b3046a6ab1d978e7ef20df1163f81f8b96","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua:455-456 (source unpinned): the source object is an 'automated saw blade'. The matching on_lose line is 'The saw embedded in #Target# flies back its source', so this is a saw blade that lodges in the target and flies back. It is not a chainsaw. The target '被链锯切割' names the wrong object. It should use 锯刃/自动锯片."},{"revision_key":"0ac4fb530400d801b9fc3de02575a52b533dbc3ce299e52bf98cdcb060269b3d","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"0b55d129c885b57adec7610c564230372c160bf29a1d976476663e1ec98b7b54","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/krimbul.lua:24-42 (source unpinned), several meaning errors: (1) L28 'If only we'd noticed that what we were feeling wasn't rejuvenation' expresses regret that they did not notice at the time. '然而直到那时，我们才发现…' reverses this into 'only then did we find out'. (2) L40 'even feeling and smelling' means touch and smell. The target '知觉和味觉' turns smelling into taste; smell is 嗅觉. (3) L36 'After the commotion ended, he strode out' becomes '在外面绝望的骚动中，纳克托什冲了出来', which moves the timing from after the commotion to during it. (4) L36 'if we couldn't purge this curse through some other means, we had to consider purging the life it fed on' is conditional and only says they had to consider it. The target '我们没有任何其他的办法…我们只有一个选择' states it as certain: no other way and only one choice."},{"revision_key":"0b59fe6ac2374aa6104ab4515cf19b3c596e65c3f6d39722db6b226fe87210e9","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-orcs/data/lore/internment-camp.lua:62-87 (source unpinned): (1) In the source, 'Administrator Quellop' (L68) and '-Galsamae' (L77) are each followed by a blank line before '#{bold}#---#{normal}#'. The target has only a single \\n in both places, so both blank lines are missing and the newline structure does not match. (2) The third letter's header 'To:' is rendered '至：', while the first two headers use '致：'. The same header is written two ways, and '至' is the wrong character here. (3) 'if things keep going this poorly' becomes '如果事情在这么糟糕下去', which should be '再'. (4) 'my first inspection' becomes '巡逻'; an inspection by an administrator is 视察/检查, not a patrol."}]}